<title>USA: Iowa Western CC, Iowa, notes won by Harris.</title>
<headline>Iowa Western CC, Iowa, notes won by Harris.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bk., said it won $3 million of Iowa Western Community College, Iowa, general obligation capital loan notes, with a net interest cost of 4.77 percent.</p>
</text>
